<title>USA: Coca-Cola Enterprises ends Nora talks.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Enterprises ends Nora talks.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Enterprises said Wednesday it ended negotiations to acquire Nora Beverages Inc.</p>
<p>Coca-Cola said it expects to continue distributing Nora's Naya products under existing distribution arrangements.</p>
<p>Coca-Cola Enterprises had been in discussions with Nora since the signing of a letter of intent on July 17, with Nora's majority share owner.</p>
</text>
